title: Predictive Curve Lighting (Map & Camera-Based Dynamic Bending)
raw_community_title: Predictive Curve Lighting (Adaptive Front Lighting System)
category: Lighting
platform: F-150 Lightning
model_years: 2022-2026
trim: Lariat / Platinum / Flash (Matrix LED Headlamps)
status: untested
source_sheet: Euro Kuga Mk3.5 / Ranger 6G Matrix LED Comparison & Livnitup Master Database
notes: |-
  UNTESTED / EXPERIMENTAL: Upgrades the Dynamic Bending Headlamps from reactive steering-wheel-only mode
  (1) to anticipatory Map/Camera-Based Dynamic Bending (4), using the IPMA front lane-tracking
  camera and SYNC 4 Navigation Electronic Horizon map stream to pre-steer the headlamp
  projectors into upcoming curves before turning the steering wheel. Also enables
  the Predictive Lighting toggle in SYNC 4 Settings > Vehicle > Lighting. Requires
  Glare-Free High Beams (ADB/DBL Combined) to be enabled.

  NOTE ON HCM CRC BITS: The HCM requires secondary CRC calculation bits (in addition to the
  standard 2-nibble checksum) and we do not currently have the offline calculation formula.
  Our working hypothesis is that setting the CRC bits to all 0s (0000) or all 1s (1111) and then,
  without resetting or power-cycling the module, immediately running the HCM headlamp calibration
  routine MIGHT trigger the module to generate the correct CRC bits internally.

  If North American map data triggers an HCM Electronic Horizon fault under mode 4, set
  HCM 734-04-02 x*xx to 2 (Camera Based Dynamic Bending Enabled) instead.
steps:
- module: APIM
  address: 7D0-05-01
  targets:
  - mask: xx*x xxxx xx--
    community_hex: '8'
    type: discrete
    bits:
    - bit: 3
      action: 1
      feature_name: Electric Horizon (EH)
      target_state: EH Electronic horizon EH
    - bit: 2
      action: 0
      feature_name: Electric Horizon Type (EHT)
      target_state: EHT MPP + Stubs
    - bit: 1
      action: 0
      feature_name: Electric Horizon Type (EHT)
      target_state: EHT MPP + Stubs
- module: APIM
  address: 7D0-09-01
  targets:
  - mask: '*xxx xxxx xx--'
    community_hex: '5'
    offset_hint: '+1'
    type: discrete
    bits:
    - bit: 0
      action: 1
      feature_name: Adaptive Head Lamps Control Function (AHLCF)
      target_state: AHLCF Enabled
- module: APIM
  address: 7D0-09-03
  targets:
  - mask: '*xxx xxxx xx--'
    community_hex: '8'
    offset_hint: '+8'
    type: discrete
    bits:
    - bit: 3
      action: 1
      feature_name: Predictive Lights (PL)
      target_state: PL Enabled
- module: IPC
  address: 720-09-02
  targets:
  - mask: '*xxx xx--'
    community_hex: '1'
    offset_hint: '+1'
    type: discrete
    bits:
    - bit: 0
      action: 1
      feature_name: Adaptive Headlamps Feature (AHF)
      target_state: AHF enabled
- module: IPC
  address: 720-10-01
  targets:
  - mask: xx*x xxxx xx--
    community_hex: '2'
    offset_hint: '+2'
    type: discrete
    bits:
    - bit: 1
      action: 1
      feature_name: Predictive Lights (PL)
      target_state: PL enabled
- module: HCM
  address: 734-04-02
  notes: |-
    Set to 4 for Map/Camera Based Dynamic Bending (or 2 for Camera-Only Dynamic Bending).
    HCM requires CRC bits: try setting CRC bits to 0000 or 1111 and running the calibration routine
    without resetting the module to see if it generates valid CRC bits.
  targets:
  - mask: x*xx xxxx xx--
    community_hex: '4'
    type: discrete
    bits:
    - bit: 2
      action: 1
      feature_name: m2_Bending_Enable (BE)
      target_state: BE Map/Camera Based Dynamic Bending Enabled
    - bit: 1
      action: 0
      feature_name: m2_Bending_Enable (BE)
      target_state: BE Map/Camera Based Dynamic Bending Enabled
    - bit: 0
      action: 0
      feature_name: m2_Bending_Enable (BE)
      target_state: BE Map/Camera Based Dynamic Bending Enabled
recipe_version: '1.1'
